    "A process crash after the no-replace move and before the machine-index commit leaves an unindexed installed directory. Recovery is deferred to the installer lifecycle, which must reconcile installed roots under its exclusive startup or ownership-and-age barrier. recoverStaging only sweeps staging and cannot safely repair that state.",
    "Production stale-staging recovery remains deferred to the package-install lifecycle. recoverStaging cannot run from read or activate because a concurrent install can own a fresh UUID staging directory.",
